<title>JAPAN: Nihon Matai files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nihon Matai files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nihon Matai Co Ltd, which manufactures plastic and paper food containers, said on Monday it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 10 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration would be effective for two years from February 14, it said.</p>
</text>
